  "title": "Cosmopsychism, the top-down form",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "d2172c19-1747-48fc-9279-5850723ba5bc",
      "text": "Constitutive cosmopsychism combines panpsychism with priority monism: the one fundamental individual is the conscious universe, and all facts, including facts about human and animal consciousness, are grounded in consciousness-involving facts about the universe.",
